WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.352
Mr. Presto stood near the black box and reached into his hat.

2
00:00:08.353 --> 00:00:10.732
He pulled out several swords.

3
00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:13.535
He looked into the camera and smiled.

4
00:00:13.536 --> 00:00:17.995
"Say good-bye to Rocket Girl," he said.

5
00:00:17.996 --> 00:00:22.865
Mr. Presto slowly pushed a sword through the box. Shlink!

6
00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:25.553
"Aah!" Mara cried.

7
00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:29.917
Mr. Presto stuck another sword through the box. Shlink!

8
00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:33.339
"Oh no!" cried Detective Smith.

9
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.611
One by one, Mr. Presto stuck all the swords through the box.

10
00:00:37.612 --> 00:00:41.218
When he was done, he opened the box.

11
00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:43.393
It was empty.

12
00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:46.393
A hole was burned through the back.

13
00:00:46.394 --> 00:00:52.343
"Aargh!" cried Mr. Presto. "Rocket Girl escaped!"

14
00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:58.083
Mr. Presto looked at the camera. "Never mind.

15
00:00:58.084 --> 00:01:07.121
It's time to make all the money in Metro City Bank disappear!"

16
00:01:07.122 --> 00:01:12.432
"Oh no!" cried Detective Smith. "Where's Rocket Girl?"

17
00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:15.448
Mr. Presto walked into Metro City Bank.

18
00:01:15.449 --> 00:01:17.527
There was a line of people.

19
00:01:17.528 --> 00:01:22.110
He waved his wand. "One, two, three . . . Presto!"

20
00:01:22.111 --> 00:01:25.080
Poof! All the people disappeared.

21
00:01:25.081 --> 00:01:28.344
A second later they appeared outside the bank.

22
00:01:28.345 --> 00:01:31.031
"What just happened?" said a man.

23
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:34.396
Inside, the bank teller looked at Mr. Presto.

24
00:01:34.397 --> 00:01:39.293
"Hello, sir," she said. "How can I help—"

25
00:01:39.294 --> 00:01:42.303
Poof! She disappeared.

26
00:01:42.304 --> 00:01:45.586
Mr. Presto went behind the counter.

27
00:01:45.587 --> 00:01:47.275
He stood in front of a door.

28
00:01:47.276 --> 00:01:49.460
It was big and round.

29
00:01:49.461 --> 00:01:51.644
It was made of solid metal.

30
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:53.980
Mr. Presto looked at the camera.

31
00:01:53.981 --> 00:01:58.408
"And now, the moment we've all been waiting for.

32
00:01:58.409 --> 00:02:02.014
Behind this door is a huge pile of money.

33
00:02:02.015 --> 00:02:05.461
And it's all going to be mine!"

34
00:02:05.462 --> 00:02:08.279
Mr. Presto raised his wand.

35
00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:15.578
"One, two, three, presto!" The door swung open.

36
00:02:15.579 --> 00:02:22.026
Mr. Presto looked in and saw—Rocket Girl!

37
00:02:22.027 --> 00:02:24.714
Terrell, Mara, and Jack cheered.

38
00:02:24.715 --> 00:02:27.987
Roxy ripped the wand from Mr. Presto's hand.

39
00:02:27.988 --> 00:02:32.523
Mr. Presto was confused. "How did you—?"

40
00:02:32.524 --> 00:02:37.471
"There will be no more magic for you, Mr. Presto!" said Roxy.

41
00:02:37.472 --> 00:02:39.638
She held the wand up with both hands.

42
00:02:39.639 --> 00:02:43.078
And she snapped it in half. Crack!

43
00:02:43.079 --> 00:02:47.368
"No!" cried Mr. Presto.

44
00:02:47.369 --> 00:02:50.403
Detective Smith breathed a sigh of relief.

45
00:02:50.404 --> 00:02:54.209
"Hurray!" shouted the Mighty Man actor.

46
00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.967
"Yay!" shouted Mara.

47
00:02:56.968 --> 00:03:00.345
She, Jack, and Terrell jumped up and down.

48
00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:04.360
"That was the best show ever!" said Terrell.

49
00:03:04.361 --> 00:03:06.706
"Yeah," said Jack.

50
00:03:06.707 --> 00:03:16.364
"I like Mighty Man, but Rocket Girl is a real superhero!"

51
00:03:16.365 --> 00:03:19.477
Several minutes later Roxy walked in.

52
00:03:19.478 --> 00:03:23.397
"Hey, guys!" she said. "I'm back!"

53
00:03:23.398 --> 00:03:26.657
Terrell looked at the TV and then at Roxy.

54
00:03:26.658 --> 00:03:29.269
He gave her a suspicious look.

55
00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:38.452
Roxy just smiled. "So . . . did I miss anything?"

